<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><view class="heading">会员订单</view><view class="notice warn section">订单与退款均为本机模拟，无真实资金流转。退款通过后只撤回对应订单剩余权益。</view><view wx:if="{{!orders.length}}" class="card section empty">暂无订单</view><view wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="id" class="card section"><view class="row"><text class="title">{{item.plan.name}}</text><text class="pill">{{item.status === 'paid' ? '模拟已支付' : item.status === 'refund_pending' ? '待审核退款' : '模拟已退款'}}</text></view><view class="caption mt">订单 {{item.id}}</view><view class="title mt">¥{{item.amount}} · {{item.plan.days}}天</view><view class="caption mt">{{item.date}} · 每日{{item.plan.dailyLimit}}次</view><button wx:if="{{item.status === 'paid'}}" class="btn white mt" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="refund">申请模拟退款</button><button wx:if="{{item.status === 'refund_pending' && (role === 'hq' || role === 'admin')}}" class="btn white mt" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="approve">审核通过模拟退款</button></view></view>